          "body_md": "By setting `arr[n] = target`, the target is guaranteed to be present in $A[0 \\dots n]$. The loop `while (arr[i] != target) ++i;` is provably guaranteed to terminate within at most $n + 1$ iterations without any explicit bounds condition `i < n`."
