      "question_category": "edge_cases_complexity",
      "stem": "In Quadratic Probing $h(k, i) = (h(k) + i^2) \\bmod M$, how can you compute the next probe index `idx_{i}` from the previous probe index `idx_{i-1}` in the probe loop without using any multiplication (`i * i`)?",
