      "stem": "Consider the following harmonic-step nested loop (where `n >= 1`):\n```cpp\nlong long work = 0;\nfor (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n    for (int j = i; j <= n; j += i) {\n        ++work;\n    }\n}\n```\nWhat is the asymptotic growth rate of `work` as a function of `n`?",
