      "stem": "What is the time complexity of the following two-pointer loop on an array of size `n >= 1`?\n```cpp\nint i = 0, j = n - 1, ops = 0;\nwhile (i < j) {\n    if (A[i] + A[j] < target) {\n        ++i;\n    } else {\n        --j;\n    }\n    ++ops;\n}\n```",
