      "correct_option_id": "C",
      "answer_explanation": "Any logarithm $\\log_2 n$ grows slower than any positive fractional power $n^{0.5} = \\sqrt{n}$, which grows slower than $n^1$, $n \\log_2 n$, $n^2$, exponential $2^n$, and factorial `n!`.",
