      "question_category": "concept_invariant",
      "stem": "Let `f(n) = 5n + 20`. Which of the following asymptotic memberships are mathematically TRUE?\n(i) `f(n) is in O(n)`\n(ii) `f(n) is in O(n^2)`\n(iii) `f(n) is in Theta(n^2)`",
