          "text": "Both (i) and (ii) are TRUE, while (iii) is FALSE (since $O(g(n))$ only requires an upper bound `<= c * g(n)`, which $5n + 20 \\le n^2$ satisfies, whereas $\\Theta(n^2)$ also requires a lower bound $\\Omega(n^2)$)."
