      "correct_option_id": "A",
      "answer_explanation": "If `x` is at 0-based index `i`, Linear Search performs `i + 1` key comparisons (`i = 0` takes 1; `i = n - 1` takes `n`). Averaging over `i = 0 .. n-1` gives `(1 + 2 + ... + n) / n = n(n + 1) / (2n) = (n + 1) / 2`.",
