      "stem": "In a self-organizing linked list, if search queries follow a highly skewed (non-uniform, e.g., 80/20 Pareto/Zipf) probability distribution where a few 'hot' items are requested repeatedly, how does the Move-to-Front heuristic improve Linear Search on a linked list?",
