      "answer_explanation": "Let `C(n)` be the total calls for `fib(n)`: `C(0)=1, C(1)=1`, and `C(n) = 1 + C(n-1) + C(n-2)`: `C(2)=3, C(3)=5, C(4)=9, C(5)=15` (in general `C(n) = 2*F_{n+1} - 1 = 2(8) - 1 = 15`). In the call tree of `fib(5)`, `fib(2)` is called from `fib(4)->fib(3)->fib(2)`, `fib(4)->fib(2)`, and `fib(3)->fib(2)` = `3` times.",
