      "stem": "Consider eliminating recursion from a recursive procedure `void trace(int lo, int hi)` that runs:\n`print(mid); trace(lo, mid - 1); trace(mid + 1, hi);` using an explicit `std::stack<Range> st`. After popping `[lo, hi]` and printing `mid`, in what order must the non-empty left `[lo, mid - 1]` and right `[mid + 1, hi]` subranges be pushed onto `st` to match recursive order?",
