      "stem": "Suppose recursive `printRange(lo, hi)` performs: `printRange(lo, mid - 1); visit(mid); printRange(mid + 1, hi);` (handling left child first, then midpoint, then right child). How can an iterative stack `st` + state variable `cur = {0, n - 1}` simulate this middle-visit order?",
