      "stem": "In the `merge` procedure of Merge Sort, when comparing an element `L[i]` from the left subarray against `R[j]` from the right subarray, why is it critical to write `if (L[i] <= R[j])` (taking `L[i]` on ties) rather than `if (L[i] < R[j])`?",
