      "stem": "Suppose you want to answer a 1D Range Count / Range Reporting query `rangeSearch(root, L, R)` (finding all keys `k` in a BST satisfying `L <= k <= R`). How does the pruning rule work at node `u`, and what is the time complexity if the tree has height `h` and `s` keys fall inside `[L, R]`?",
