      "question_category": "complexity_analysis",
      "stem": "A graph `G = (V, E)` with `|V| = V` vertices and `|E| = E` edges is stored using a `V x V` Adjacency Matrix vs an Adjacency List (`std::vector<std::vector<int>> adj(V)`). What are the exact asymptotic space complexities of these two representations?",
