      "question_category": "tradeoff_choice",
      "stem": "Consider the Edge List graph representation `std::vector<Edge> edges;` where each record stores `{int u, int v, int weight}` for all `E` edges. Which graph access pattern and space profile naturally favors this flat Edge List over an Adjacency Matrix or Adjacency List?",
