      "stem": "Suppose an undirected graph `G = (V, E)` is disconnected and has `k = 4` connected components. If we call a standard single-source `bfs(0)` starting only at vertex `0`, how many components are explored, and how do we find all `k` connected components in $O(V + E)$ total time?",
