        "C": "Partial overlap `d[u] < d[v] < f[u] < f[v]` violates LIFO call-stack nesting and can *never* occur in DFS.",
        "D": "`(f[u] - d[u] - 1) / 2` equals the number of proper descendants of `u` in the DFS tree, not $\\deg^+(u)$."
