      "stem": "Let u and v be distinct vertices in a directed or undirected graph. Use the White-Path Theorem convention that inspects colors immediately BEFORE DFS-Visit(u) changes u from WHITE to GRAY. Vertex v becomes a descendant of u in the DFS forest if and only if, at that instant:",
