        "B": "This swaps the two formulas (`m + n - 2L` vs `m + n - L`).",
        "C": "`|m - n|` ignores mismatched characters when `m == n` (e.g., `X = \"AB\", Y = \"CD\"` has `|m - n| = 0` but requires `4` operations)."
