      "stem": "Suppose you are given an array `A` of `n` distinct integers and asked to find the length of its Longest Increasing Subsequence (LIS) strictly by reducing it to the Longest Common Subsequence (LCS) problem. How is that reduction constructed, and what is its time complexity using standard LCS DP?",
