      "stem": "What is the Triangle Inequality (Metric TSP) assumption (`d(u, v) <= d(u, w) + d(w, v)` for all `u, v, w`), and why does the Twice-Around-the-Tree (MST-based) heuristic achieve a guaranteed 2-approximation (`cost <= 2 * OPT_TSP`) on Metric TSP?",
