      "question_category": "concept_invariant",
      "stem": "In a Flow Network `G = (V, E)` with source `s`, sink `t`, and non-negative edge capacities `c(u, v) >= 0`, what two fundamental constraints must a valid flow `f : V x V -> R` satisfy?",
