            "field": "distractor_explanations.D",
            "status": "partial_support",
            "claim": "Even n runs only the single Theta(n) loop so best case is Theta(n), not Theta(n^2).",
            "reason": "Only one parity branch executes: n iterations for even size, n^2 for odd size. These are subsequences of sizes, not distinct inputs of the same fixed n; case terminology should preserve that distinction."
