              "text": "It starts with Quick Sort, switches to Heap Sort if depth exceeds $2 \\cdot \\lfloor \\log_2 n \\rfloor$ (guaranteeing $O(n \\log n)$ worst-case time), and uses Insertion Sort for size `<= 16`."
