            "claim": "RB guarantees <= 2 insert / <= 3 delete rotations (+ O(1) amortized color flips), driving std::map/set and Linux CFS adoption over AVL's O(log n) delete rotations.",
            "reason": "Rotation bounds are covered, but map/set implementation and scheduler adoption are implementation/history assertions beyond insertion/removal passages."
